---
---
<div class="flows">
  <div class="flow-block">
    <p class="flow-label">一般的なイヤホン</p>
    <div class="flow">
      <span class="step">音の信号</span><span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
      <span class="step">空気の振動</span><span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
      <span class="step">鼓膜</span><span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
      <span class="step">内耳</span><span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
      <span class="step">脳</span>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="flow-block">
    <p class="flow-label">骨伝導イヤホン</p>
    <div class="flow">
      <span class="step">音の信号</span><span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
      <span class="step hl">本体が振動</span><span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
      <span class="step hl">頬のあたりの骨</span><span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
      <span class="step">内耳</span><span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
      <span class="step">脳</span>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="meta">耳の穴をふさがずに音を聞くので、周囲の音も同時に聞こえやすいのが特徴です(Shokz公式サイトの説明をもとに、簡単にまとめた図です)。製品によっては、骨伝導に加えて、空気を通る音も併用するものがあります。</p>
</div>
